What does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my @scores = (3, 1, 20, 100);
my @sorted = sort @scores;
say "@sorted";
```

What number does this program print?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my @letters = qw(a b c d e);
my $n = @letters;
say $n + $#letters;
```

This program prints some fruit names, one per line. Which ones?

```perl
use strict;
use warnings;
use feature qw(say);
my %stock = (apple => 3, pear => 0, plum => 7, fig => undef);
delete $stock{plum};
my @known = grep { defined $stock{$_} } keys %stock;
say for sort @known;
```

